    "description": "Discover a rare urban oasis in Fairmount Heights! Steps from Noe Valley, Glen Park, and Bernal Heights, this charming, light-filled 3-Bdrm, 2-Bath Victorian gem offers period details including high ceilings, parlor LR/DR and rich wood floors, plus a delightful modern kitchen featuring walls of windows that open seamlessly to an expansive view deck with captivating city and bay views - indoor-outdoor living at its best. Ideal for those seeking a city escape, it offers a private, vibrant yard filled with fruit trees and a lush lawn, perfect for entertaining, playing, and gardening. Downstairs you will find a flexible primary suite plus garden lounge, a 1-car garage with interior access, and a creative bonus space that offers additional versatility and expansion potential. Located on a desirable, tree-lined street, it offers easy access to parks, shops, transit, and convenient freeway access in and out of the city, blending urban living with serene tranquility. A true gem!"
  },
